The ACPI resource descriptors `EFI_PCI_ROOT_BRIDGE_IO_PROTOCOL::Configuration`
answered with on the one root bridge of the ThinkPad T14 this repository is
tested on, off that machine's own firmware.

  root-bridge-0.bin   186 bytes, off the `Root bridge: 0 (segment 0) 186 bytes:`
                      line in the `loader.log` the stick came back with from
                      metal run 33 (`tests/metalcase`).

The bootloader printed the bytes and nothing decoded them on the way. What says
the length was right is the file itself: four descriptors whose own declared
lengths tile it exactly, then the End Tag.
